## 3. Voltage Divider for HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Echo Pins

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The HC-SR04 Echo output is 5.0V, but the ESP32 GPIO inputs are rated for **3.3V maximum**. Use a simple 2-resistor voltage divider on each Echo pin:

```
HC-SR04 ECHO (5V Out) ───[ 1.0 kΩ ]───┬───> ESP32 ECHO GPIO Pin (3.3V)
                                       │
                                   [ 2.0 kΩ ]
                                       │
                                      GND
```

