## 5. ESP32-CAM Wiring & Flashing Setup

The AI-Thinker ESP32-CAM does not have an onboard USB-to-UART chip. Use an **FTDI USB-to-TTL programmer**:

```
FTDI Programmer           ESP32-CAM
  5V / VCC   ───────────>   5V (Pin 1)
  GND        ───────────>   GND
  TXD        ───────────>   U0R (GPIO 3)
  RXD        ───────────>   U0T (GPIO 1)

* TO FLASH CODE: Connect GPIO 0 to GND, then press RST button.
* TO RUN STREAM: Disconnect GPIO 0 from GND, then press RST button.
```
